            <p>FLUX dev is built on a foundation of cutting-edge AI technology, incorporating the latest advancements in generative models:</p>
            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>Hybrid architecture combining multimodal and parallel diffusion transformer blocks for enhanced performance</li>
                <li>Scaled to an impressive 12B parameters, ensuring robust and versatile image generation capabilities</li>
