            <h3>Core Components of FLUX dev Architecture</h3>
            <p>Let's delve deeper into the key technological components that make FLUX dev a powerhouse in AI image generation:</p>
            
            <h4>Multimodal Diffusion Transformers</h4>
            <p>FLUX dev utilizes a novel approach combining the strengths of diffusion models and transformer architectures, allowing for more coherent and contextually aware image generation.</p>
            
            <h4>Flow Matching Optimization</h4>
            <p>By incorporating flow matching techniques, FLUX dev achieves faster convergence and improved sample quality compared to traditional diffusion models.</p>
            
            <h4>Rotary Positional Embeddings</h4>
            <p>This advanced embedding technique enables FLUX dev to better understand and maintain spatial relationships within generated images, resulting in more coherent and realistic outputs.</p>
